     AcuCobol, Inc.			                     Prolin
     a/Soft Development		                   Research Systems
     Advanced Systems Concepts, Inc.          		 Software &
                                              Management Associates
     BEA Systems, Inc.	                 Solutions IQ (formerly CNA)
     BMC Software, Inc.		                     Symark Software
     Computer Associates	                Syncsort Corporation
     ISE, Inc.	                          TIBCO (formerly Teknekron)
     ISG/Navigator		                     Vector Networks
     Northlake Software		                     Wall Data, Inc.
     Platinum Technology			                XuiS

Delivering Support Services

     A new suite of Digital support services is designed to help 
customers implement and operate client/server applications 
successfully in an integrated OpenVMS and Windows NT environment. 
Included are one-time and ongoing services that address alignment of 
business and information-technology strategy, building a 
client/server infrastructure, integrating and migrating to the new
environment, and managing and operating the environment. In 
addition, new system integration services from Digital ease 
assessment, deployment and integration of enterprise messaging 
systems across OpenVMS, Windows NT and other platforms.

     Digital Equipment Corporation is the world's leader in open 
client/server solutions from personal computing to integrated 
worldwide information systems.  Digital's scaleable Alpha platforms, 
storage, networking, software and services, together with 
industry-focused solutions from business partners, help 
organizations compete and win in today's global marketplace.

