 The following statement was released this morning by Charles F. 
 Christ, vice president and general manager of Digital Equipment 
 Corporation's Components Division.
 
 "Contrary to a published report, Digital is not closing its Hudson
 facility.  As stated previously, Digital is phasing down a prior 
 generation of 0.5 micron process semiconductor technology and moving 
 to the next generation of 0.35 technology, in support of its 
